{
  "connections": {
    "categories": [
      {
        "name": "مَظَاهِرُ العَالَمِ الطَّبِيعِيِّ",
        "nameEn": "Features of the natural world",
        "color": "yellow",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "السَّمَاوَاتِ",
            "en": "the heavens",
            "ref": "17:99",
            "verse": "۞ أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ أَنَّ ٱللَّهَ ٱلَّذِى خَلَقَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضَ قَادِرٌ عَلَىٰٓ أَن يَخْلُقَ مِثْلَهُمْ وَجَعَلَ لَهُمْ أَجَلًۭا لَّا رَيْبَ فِيهِ فَأَبَى ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ إِلَّا كُفُورًۭا",
            "verseEn": "Do they not see that Allāh, who created the heavens and earth, is [the one] Able to create the likes of them? And He has appointed for them a term, about which there is no doubt. But the wrongdoers refuse except disbelief."
          },
          {
            "ar": "الْأَرْضِ",
            "en": "the earth ",
            "ref": "26:7",
            "verse": "أَوَلَمْ يَرَوْا۟ إِلَى ٱلْأَرْضِ كَمْ أَنۢبَتْنَا فِيهَا مِن كُلِّ زَوْجٍۢ كَرِيمٍ",
            "verseEn": "Did they not look at the earth - how much We have produced therein from every noble kind?"
          },
          {
            "ar": "الْجِبَالُ",
            "en": "the mountain",
            "ref": "19:90",
            "verse": "تَكَادُ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتُ يَتَفَطَّرْنَ مِنْهُ وَتَنشَقُّ ٱلْأَرْضُ وَتَخِرُّ ٱلْجِبَالُ هَدًّا",
            "verseEn": "The heavens almost rupture therefrom and the earth splits open and the mountains collapse in devastation"
          },
          {
            "ar": "الْيَمِّ",
            "en": "the sea",
            "ref": "28:40",
            "verse": "فَأَخَذْنَـٰهُ وَجُنُودَهُۥ فَنَبَذْنَـٰهُمْ فِى ٱلْيَمِّ ۖ فَٱنظُرْ كَيْفَ كَانَ عَـٰقِبَةُ ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ",
            "verseEn": "So We took him and his soldiers and threw them into the sea. So see how was the end of the wrongdoers."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "أَلْفَاظُ الآخِرَةِ وَالْحِسَابِ",
        "nameEn": "Words for the Hereafter and Final Reckoning",
        "color": "green",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "الْقِيَامَةِ",
            "en": "(of) the Resurrection",
            "ref": "19:95",
            "verse": "وَكُلُّهُمْ ءَاتِيهِ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ فَرْدًا",
            "verseEn": "And all of them are coming to Him on the Day of Resurrection alone."
          },
          {
            "ar": "حِسَابٍ",
            "en": "account",
            "ref": "38:39",
            "verse": "هَـٰذَا عَطَآؤُنَا فَٱمْنُنْ أَوْ أَمْسِكْ بِغَيْرِ حِسَابٍۢ",
            "verseEn": "[We said], \"This is Our gift, so grant or withhold without account.\""
          },
          {
            "ar": "الدِّينَ",
            "en": "(in) the religion",
            "ref": "39:11",
            "verse": "قُلْ إِنِّىٓ أُمِرْتُ أَنْ أَعْبُدَ ٱللَّهَ مُخْلِصًۭا لَّهُ ٱلدِّينَ",
            "verseEn": "Say, [O Muḥammad], \"Indeed, I have been commanded to worship Allāh, [being] sincere to Him in religion."
          },
          {
            "ar": "الْآخِرَةِ",
            "en": "(of) the Hereafter ",
            "ref": "42:20",
            "verse": "مَن كَانَ يُرِيدُ حَرْثَ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ نَزِدْ لَهُۥ فِى حَرْثِهِۦ ۖ وَمَن كَانَ يُرِيدُ حَرْثَ ٱلدُّنْيَا نُؤْتِهِۦ مِنْهَا وَمَا لَهُۥ فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ مِن نَّصِيبٍ",
            "verseEn": "Whoever desires the harvest of the Hereafter - We increase for him in his harvest [i.e., reward]. And whoever desires the harvest [i.e., benefits] of this world - We give him thereof, but there is not for him in the Hereafter any share."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "أَفْعَالُ السُّخْرِيَةِ وَالِاسْتِهْزَاءِ",
        "nameEn": "Verbs of mockery, laughter and insult toward revelation",
        "color": "blue",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "وَيَسْخَرُونَ",
            "en": "while they mock",
            "ref": "37:12",
            "verse": "بَلْ عَجِبْتَ وَيَسْخَرُونَ",
            "verseEn": "But you wonder, while they mock,"
          },
          {
            "ar": "يَسْتَهْزِئُونَ",
            "en": "mock",
            "ref": "39:48",
            "verse": "وَبَدَا لَهُمْ سَيِّـَٔاتُ مَا كَسَبُوا۟ وَحَاقَ بِهِم مَّا كَانُوا۟ بِهِۦ يَسْتَهْزِءُونَ",
            "verseEn": "And there will appear to them the evils they had earned, and they will be enveloped by what they used to ridicule."
          },
          {
            "ar": "يَضْحَكُونَ",
            "en": "laughed",
            "ref": "43:47",
            "verse": "فَلَمَّا جَآءَهُم بِـَٔايَـٰتِنَآ إِذَا هُم مِّنْهَا يَضْحَكُونَ",
            "verseEn": "But when he brought them Our signs, at once they laughed at them."
          },
          {
            "ar": "فَيَسُبُّوا",
            "en": "lest they insult",
            "ref": "6:108",
            "verse": "وَلَا تَسُبُّوا۟ ٱلَّذِينَ يَدْعُونَ مِن دُونِ ٱللَّهِ فَيَسُبُّوا۟ ٱللَّهَ عَدْوًۢا بِغَيْرِ عِلْمٍۢ ۗ كَذَٰلِكَ زَيَّنَّا لِكُلِّ أُمَّةٍ عَمَلَهُمْ ثُمَّ إِلَىٰ رَبِّهِم مَّرْجِعُهُمْ فَيُنَبِّئُهُم بِمَا كَانُوا۟ يَعْمَلُونَ",
            "verseEn": "And do not insult those they invoke other than Allāh, lest they insult Allāh in enmity without knowledge. Thus We have made pleasing to every community their deeds. Then to their Lord is their return, and He will inform them about what they used to do."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "أَلْقَابُ السُّلْطَةِ وَالنُّخْبَةِ",
        "nameEn": "Titles for earthly rulers and elites",
        "color": "purple",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "سَادَتَنَا",
            "en": "our chiefs",
            "ref": "33:67",
            "verse": "وَقَالُوا۟ رَبَّنَآ إِنَّآ أَطَعْنَا سَادَتَنَا وَكُبَرَآءَنَا فَأَضَلُّونَا ٱلسَّبِيلَا۠",
            "verseEn": "And they will say, \"Our Lord, indeed we obeyed our masters and our dignitaries, and they led us astray from the [right] way."
          },
